   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Nobody's here. What am[n]I even watching for?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_2#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Is it even possible for anyone[n]to break into this place?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_3#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Gold bars... They won't[n]notice if I pocket a few,[n]will they?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_4#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "*sigh* I wish we'd get[n]more staff. I want to take[n]more breaks...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_5#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "How much longer do[n]I have to guard against[n]nothing?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_6#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I wanna punch someone...[n]I don't care who. Thieves,[n]kids, anybody...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_7#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Ahhh, I love the scent of cash...[n]I could smell those fat[n]stacks forever.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_8#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Ahaha, Mr. Kaneshiro's such a[n]worrywart! Can't blame him,[n]with that kinda money...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
