   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_0_9#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Is anyone there?[n]Come get me!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "If I don't keep this place[n]secure, I'm gonna be[n]out of a job...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_1_2#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Man, I wish I could grab a[n]beer with Mr. Kaneshiro![n]Hahaha!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
