   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_1_8#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Cash flow is great today,[n]as usual. Mr. Kaneshiro's[n]on a roll! Ahaha!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML03_MNLG_FREE_01_1_9#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Leave security to us![n]We're always on guard...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
